@HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

### 1. Get All Users (As Admin)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Accept: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

### 2. Create a Manager User (As Admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "name": "Manager Bob",
  "email": "bob@lms.com",
  "password": "pass",
  "role": 1
}

### 3. Create an Employee User (As Admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "name": "Employee Alice",
  "email": "alice@lms.com",
  "password": "pass",
  "role": 2,
  "managerId": 2
}

### 4. Get Leave Types (As Admin)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/leavetypes
Accept: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

### 5. Add New Leave Type (As Admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/leavetypes
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "name": "Paternity Leave",
  "defaultQuota": 5
}
